      {
        "text": "Lindsey LaPointe represents Chicago’s 19th District and chairs the House Mental Health and Addiction Committee. A former social worker, she managed justice reform at Business and Professional People for the Public Interest and the state's Adult Redeploy Illinois program.",
        "cites": [1, 2],
        "sentences": [
